WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:48.850
Laughter echoes over

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:52.860
the emerald green city.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.790
That's not right!

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:55.900
It's like this:

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.870
Laughter echoes over

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:01.120
If you're wondering how something like this ended up happening...

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:04.350
the emerald green city.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.200
It all started some days ago.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:04.860
It is time for a flashback!

00:02:06.910 --> 00:02:08.390
Summer School Day

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.420
Doesn't it feel like everyone's full of summer vacation spirit?

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.850
It truly does.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.260
Hinamori-senpai!

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.380
Senpai!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.860
I'm so glad I get to see you even during summer vacation!

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.560
Viva Summer School Day!

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:30.720
Who are you?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:34.690
It's me, me! I'm Suzuki Seichiro!

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:37.280
Suzuki Seichiro?

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.960
Right, my glasses.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:42.260
Oh, you!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.690
You remember me now?

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:47.520
I guess I screwed up by wearing contacts for a change of pace.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.570
He is really handsome without his glasses.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.270
Speaking of which, his name is apparently Seichiro.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:59.260
Episode 45
Go for it! Seichiro!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.050
Choral Competition

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:07.680
And so, our Seiyo Elementary will be participating in the Choral Competition.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:13.470
The event will take place during summer vacation, so let's all do a great job together!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:18.760
It's a bit sudden, but we're gonna decide who'll be playing the piano and singing the solo now.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.850
Let's audition!

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.180
The piano is perfectly suited to a lady celebrity!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.390
Behold, all of you, my technique!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.850
We can't wait!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:43.830
She's fantastic.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.770
But she's using her own arrangement.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.000
And now, the results.

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:05.130
First, the piano accompaniment will be played by...

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.130
Hatanaka Marimo-san, of the fourth grade's Star Class.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.680
Me?

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.220
Excuse me, people! Did you not hear my exquisite performance?

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.760
We couldn't sing to something like that.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:23.180
Next, the vocal soloist will be Hinamori Amu-san, of the sixth grade's Star Class.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.000
I see.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.300
Wait, me?!

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:28.430
Why? I didn't even audition!

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.360
Hinamori Amu's the only one for the solo!

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.580
The only one!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.680
Right on!

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:36.600
You didn't ask me to, but I entered your name!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:39.270
It seems there were some large voting blocks.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.640
And no one else really wanted to do it.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.700
Good luck, Hinamori-san.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.200
There you have it.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.430
Can't change it now, right?

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.680
Go for it, go for it, Amu-chan!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:06.020
Laughter echoes over

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:11.680
the emerald green city.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.390
Isn't he awful?

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.510
Yeah.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.060
Me? I'm sorry!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.480
All right, that's enough for today.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.390
I'm beat.

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.070
Just from singing?

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:34.170
Singing in front of people!

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.800
Where everyone can hear you!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.390
I even suck at karaoke!

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.000
Amu-chan is...

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.600
Really bad...

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.470
At sing-

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.150
-ing!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.660
Ah, stop singing!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.680
Do you hear that?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.720
He is practicing all by himself.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.030
Good for him.

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:06.730
You really have to admit he's not cut out for the performing arts. 

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.480
It's just no use!

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:13.550
Hey, look at you.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.710
Hinamori-senpai!

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:19.270
You saw me doing something lame again!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:25.140
Oh no! Now I've no choice but to disqualify myself as your fan!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.390
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.310
Since you've become a Guardian, you've been lively

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.700
and active and shining brighter by the day!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.360
But I haven't progressed one bit!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.470
Uh, that's not true. Is it?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.090
I don't really know, though.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:46.560
It's times like this that make me think I can't do anything at all.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.330
You shouldn't go that far, you know?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.560
I don't really know, though.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:53.090
Right, but no need to worry.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:58.390
If I can't improve my singing by the day of the competition, I'll just pretend to sing!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.950
You can do that?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.690
But if I just pretend to sing at the real thing...

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:11.850
If I don't sing during the solo, there won't be any music!

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:13.640
Hinamori-san!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:18.460
I'd like to practice my conducting, so could you do your solo for me?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.180
Suzuki-kun?

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.550
Hatanaka-san!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.220
Let's practice together.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:33.320
Huh?

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.390
It's difficult to sing without the accompaniment, right?

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.240
I'll play the piano for you.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.690
No, I don't want to bother you.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.930
It's okay. I do have to practice the accompaniment.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:45.970
Let's work together.

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:51.050
I look forward to practicing with you!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.220
So do I.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:08:05.770
That important life in everyone...

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:19.060
The blue light! Our world!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.560
Hey, I think we're on the right track, you know?

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:24.520
We might get the grand prize!

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:29.730
But it's not a matter of winning or losing, it's about everyone working together to enter the-

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:33.100
There it is, Tadase's honor student speech.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.770
Amu-chi, what do you think?

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:37.370
Are you still nervous?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.010
No way. Something like this doesn't...

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.700
There it is, Amu's stubborn girl speech.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:49.580
I'm beat again today.

00:08:50.810 --> 00:09:01.090
The blue light! Our world!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.220
Look at him.

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.530
Yeah, that's a lot better than before.

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:08.720
When you sing with confidence, anyway. When you hunch over, your pitch gets a bit off.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.910
Of course, I understand completely!

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:14.520
I'm your classmate, so you don't have to be so formal with me.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:17.490
Uh, yeah!  Got it!

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:19.220
Is speaking in that manner acceptable?

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.520
Oh, it's fine.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:22.930
Okay. One more time?

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:24.060
Yes!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.810
I mean, sure!

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.470
How nice.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.400
Yeah!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.450
I'm sorry for keeping you out this late.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:42.050
It's no problem at all. I got a lot of practicing in, too.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.840
Do you really think I can sing well?

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.310
You'll be fine.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:51.780
And besides, I don't think singing well is what matters most.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:52.640
Huh?

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:58.390
Just have fun. The word for "music" is written using the characters for "sound" and "fun," right?

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.960
There's no point if you're not having fun.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:03.570
You think so?

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:07.180
The truth is, I'm not that good, either.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:09.570
That's not true! You're very...

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.890
No, it's okay. I know it myself.

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:18.120
Sometimes, I do think about how I'm not that great.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:24.640
And when I think about how amazing the people who'll be pros are, I envy them.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.100
But my dream, you see...

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.480
Don't laugh, okay?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:33.600
I won't. Promise!

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:38.470
I want to play the piano, always, even after I'm married.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:45.880
I want to play the piano with my husband and children every day!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.030
That's my dream!

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:53.380
M-M-M-M-M-Married?!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.460
Is that strange?

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.060
Not at all! I think it's a wonderful dream!

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.180
What's the matter?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.600
Don't look at me!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.350
What is it?

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.220
That girl...

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:10.620
Let's do our best together, okay?

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:11.800
Yeah!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:16.060
I get the feeling she's plotting something.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:30.810
Tomorrow is finally the real performance, so this is our last rehearsal.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:42.310
Laughter echoes over the emerald green-

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:45.900
I'm sorry. Can we try again?

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:46.910
Of course.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.060
No, you cannot!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:55.200
If you botch such a simple song now, what do you think will happen tomorrow?

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:59.220
Perhaps it would've been better if Saya-sama had been chosen to perform the accompaniment, after all?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.430
It'll be fine. Once more, from the top.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:06.030
If it were Saya-sama, the grand prize wouldn't just be a dream.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.180
Yeah, you'd definitely win.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.200
This just doesn't sit right.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.770
Definitely.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.640
It's harassment, I tell you.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:17.020
I'm sorry, I'll try harder.

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:20.430
No matter how hard you try, will it ever be good enough?

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:21.720
Hey!

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:24.520
Music is about having fun with sound!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:29.770
So winning isn't what's important. What's important is to have fun participating!

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.790
Huh? If you're not aiming for the grand prize, what <i>are</i> you aiming for?

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:38.990
Just participating? What's the point in that?

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:41.520
Doesn't everyone want to win?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:44.120
Well, winning would be nice.

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:44.720
Yeah.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.480
Hey, we all chose her!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.680
The masses are always fickle.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.560
Please calm down, everyone.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:55.280
If you're going to do something, there's no point unless you're number one.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:58.130
Saying it's okay to be average, or just to have fun...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.820
Those are merely excuses for people who can't be number one!

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.270
Is there even any point in doing something if you can't distinguish yourself?

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.260
The grand prize?

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.680
It might be impossible with the accompaniment we have.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.180
Everyone!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.670
Hatanaka-san.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:21.870
I'm okay. I think it'd be better if someone else did it.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:23.180
Pardon me!

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.290
Tadase-kun, I'm going to go check on her.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.150
Right.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:33.390
Finally, it is my time to shine!

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:37.090
Now, Tadase-sama, conduct!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.880
Okay.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:51.930
I want to tell you my "love heart" to your heart!

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.930
Saya-sama.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:57.160
Hatanaka-san, wait up!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.770
What is it?

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:03.050
I think it'd be better for you to play the piano.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.520
So...

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:11.360
Thank you very much. But I believe it'd be better to have someone who is more skilled.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.680
Be sure to come! We'll be waiting!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.690
She was crying.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.610
Well, if someone said those things to you...

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:32.020
I want to play the piano, always.

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:42.740
There's no point in doing something if you can't distinguish yourself?

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.850
I wonder if that's really true.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.860
There's no way!

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:50.450
I think that having fun is what matters most.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:55.980
Yeah. If you're just distinguishing yourself, you'd be the only one having fun.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.940
Do you think Hatanaka-san will come?

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.560
23rd Choral Competition

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.400
23rd Choral Competition Hall

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.520
I'm getting all nervous.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.610
Hey, Amu-chi, is my ribbon crooked?

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.020
Amu-chi?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.150
It doesn't look like she can spare a moment to pay attention to other people, does it?

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.120
Frozen solid.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.530
Oh my.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.140
Hinamori-san.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.320
Have you seen Hatanaka-san?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.430
Hatanaka-san?

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.340
Now that you mention it, I haven't.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:34.890
This is bad, it's almost our turn.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:37.560
There's not much we can do. What about Yamabuki-san?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.810
Let me go! If I don't play, who will?!

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:44.660
Saya-sama's performance is definitely wonderful.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.060
But it doesn't suit an ensemble, you know?

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.850
Should I really go?

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.350
Saying it's okay to be average, or just to have fun...

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:04.430
Those are merely excuses for people who can't be number one!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.390
An X Egg was born!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.700
Really?

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.930
Hinamori-san.

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:21.210
We're Guardians, so we have to go, right?

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:21.890
Yeah.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:25.320
Um, I'm sure Hatanaka-san will come!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.930
I'll search for her!

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:30.220
Wa- Let's go, too!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.270
Right.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.350
Hatanaka-san!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.640
I think I heard something.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.060
Forte!

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.390
My glasses!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.390
I was wrong.

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.060
Amu-chi, over there!

00:16:58.390 --> 00:16:59.850
It's already turned into an X Character!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.080
Let's go!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.470
Wait a sec.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:11.310
Hatanaka-san! You weren't wrong, Hatanaka-san!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:14.810
Maybe he can't see the X Character without his glasses?

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:19.120
Hatanaka-san, didn't you tell me your dream?

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:21.520
You said you want to keep playing the piano, always!

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:25.450
But everyone says there's no point unless you're the best!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.020
It's a worthless dream!

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:30.350
There's no such thing as a worthless dream!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:36.200
I'm the same. Studying, sports... I'm not the best at a lot of things.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.640
But I still have dreams.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.990
Someday, I want to be president of a company.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.770
I want to be an astronaut.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.470
I also want to be a race car driver!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:48.640
That's stupid! There's no point in having dreams like those!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.720
Forte!

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:52.700
Hinamori-san, it's getting dangerous!

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:56.220
There might not be a point, but...

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:01.170
Right now, all I have to hold on to are my dreams!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:08.150
If I start to think my dreams are worthless, I'd just be pathetic!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:12.930
My dreams are mine alone, no one else's!

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:16.100
And my dreams are what matter most!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:18.600
That's right!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:23.920
Your dreams belong to no one else. To you, they're the most important dreams.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.710
Hinamori-senpai?

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.340
You did good, kid.

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:33.830
My heart:

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:35.340
Unlock!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.390
Hinamori-senpai is shining all pink!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.930
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:58.670
Fortissimo!

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:01.140
Ah, sorry!

00:19:04.060 --> 00:19:05.240
Forte!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:14.180
I like your piano playing.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:20.470
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.680
Open Heart!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:46.930
Thank you, Hinamori-san. And Suzuki-kun as well.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.930
My glasses...

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.730
Until we meet again.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:50.800
Right.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:51.970
Found them!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:58.130
H-Hinamori-senpai, what are you wearing?

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.890
Cosplay?

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.600
I had no idea you were into that kind of thing.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.380
I've discovered a new charm of yours!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.490
Ah, crap!

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.020
He called it cosplay...

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.770
That's just too mean.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.770
Huh? What was I...

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:16.790
Everything's fine now!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:21.270
Hatanaka-san, can you please perform the piano accompaniment?

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.850
Sure!

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:36.100
Hold on to your dreams and courage, and fly up into the sky.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:46.180
For freedom and aspirations are precious things.

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.150
Love one another.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:52.020
Rejoice.

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.890
Just helpin' out with a little Character Change.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:57.100
We're treating you just for today, all right?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:12.520
You and that smile of yours encompass my wonderful world!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.450
It's finally over.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.810
You wouldn't think the main character would get this tired, you know?

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.810
You did so well!

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.330
Thank you.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.410
What's up? You've been staring this whole time.

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:28.100
Huh?

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:31.070
Oh! Have you fallen for her?

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.810
Wh-What are you saying, Hinamori-senpai?

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:37.050
I think you said some good lines before.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.380
Why don't you just straight-out confess to her?

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.640
No way!

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:47.500
It's good enough for me to know that I can pull through if I put my mind to it.

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:52.350
If I ever get more confidence in myself, then maybe...

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:57.390
You can do it, Suzuki Seichiro!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.090
Sorry, did that hurt?

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:01.260
I'm touched!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.810
That was the first time you've ever said my full name, Hinamori-senpai!

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:08.720
You! Said! My! Name!

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:51.740
Let's do this, Amu.

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.140
Give me 100 straight man responses!

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:54.730
What the heck?! What the heck?!

00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:56.310
Next! Vocal exercises!

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:57.770
Ah! Ah!

00:23:57.850 --> 00:23:59.230
Hey, wait!

00:23:59.260 --> 00:24:02.140
There's no such thing! Comedy is a serious battle!

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:04.670
Why exactly do I have to do comedy?

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:07.830
Aren't you participating in the next Guffaw Grand Stage?

00:24:07.880 --> 00:24:09.750
You think I'd do something like that?!

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:11.550
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.610 --> 00:24:14.150
The Advent of Rima!? Goddess of Comedy!

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:15.940
Goddess of Comedy?

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:17.360
I wonder about that.

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:20.100
Well, that's because it's still a secret!
